			"Message": "docs(Maintain): Standardize emoji rendering and markdown syntax\n\nUpdate `Documentation/GitHub/DeepDive.md` and `README.md` to ensure consistent emoji rendering in GitHub markdown by replacing raw emoji characters with their corresponding HTML entities (e.g., `&#x2001;💪🏻`). This prevents font fallback issues and ensures a uniform visual presentation in the rendered documentation.\n\nAdditionally, standardize the Mermaid diagram subgraph labels in DeepDive.md by replacing the en-dash with a space (`Maintain: Deep Dive` and `Maintain Build System`) to align with the project's naming conventions and improve diagram clarity.\n\nThese changes enhance the professional presentation of the Maintain build system documentation while preserving the semantic content.",
			"SHA": "301d29457a9bee5a8b84495bccb693373be0c68b"
		}
